---

## Section 1 — ProjectsPage

### Purpose & Flow Context

Lists projects for the selected team with status filtering and pagination. Entry point for the create project flow via the "New Project" button. User arrives from nav sidebar; exits to ProjectDetailPage on card click or to CreateProjectDialog on "New Project".

### Layout Regions

**Grid**: 12-column. Spacing cadence: 8px.

**App-shell**: Shared header + sidebar + main container. Inherits from system shell.

**Content hierarchy**:
1. Page title + actions (h1 "Projects", status filter, "New Project" button)
2. Error banner (conditional)
3. Project card grid
4. Pagination sentinel / scroll trigger

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  [Header — shared app-shell]                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  # Projects                    [>Status ▼]  [+ New Project]  ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|                                                                |
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|  |  [ErrorBanner] if error           [Retry]                    ||
|  +--------------------------------------------------------------+|
|                                                                |
|  +-- ProjectCard ---+  +-- ProjectCard ---+  +-- ProjectCard -+|
|  |  [icon] [name]   |  |  [icon] [name]   |  |  [icon] [name] ||
|  |  Status badge    |  |  Status badge    |  |  Status badge   ||
|  |  Progress bar    |  |  Progress bar    |  |  Progress bar   ||
|  +------------------+  +------------------+  +------------------+|
|                                                                |
|  +-- ProjectCard ---+  +-- ProjectCard ---+                     |
|  |  [icon] [name]   |  |  [icon] [name]   |                     |
|  |  Status badge    |  |  Status badge    |                     |
|  |  Progress bar    |  |  Progress bar    |                     |
|  +------------------+  +------------------+                     |
|                                                                |
|              [Spinner — loading more...]                        |
|         "No more projects to show" (when hasMore=false)         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| "New Project" button | Button (primary, md) | Opens CreateProjectDialog | Disabled when no team selected |
| Status filter | Select | Filters projects by status | "All" option clears filter |
| Project card | ProjectCard | Navigate to `/projects/{id}` on click | Truncation on long names |
| Error state | ErrorBanner + Button(retry) | Shows error + retry action | Inline, not blocking |
| Loading (initial) | SkeletonCard (placeholder) | Skeleton card grid mirroring populated layout | Shows only when projects empty |
| Loading (more) | Spinner (md) | At bottom of list | Shown during pagination |
| Empty state | EmptyState | Icon + title + description | Distinguishes filter-empty vs first-run |
| Scroll sentinel | `<div>` (invisible) | Triggers `fetchMore` via IntersectionObserver | Hidden when hasMore=false |

### Data Display

**Card grid** (3 cols lg, 2 cols sm, 1 col mobile). Each card shows: icon, name, status badge, progress bar. Click navigates to detail.

### Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| "Projects" | Page title | h1 |
| "New Project" | Primary CTA button | Consistent terminology across screens |
| Filter by status | Filter dropdown placeholder | — |
| "Create your first project to get started" | First-run empty state | CTA leads to create dialog |
| "No projects match this filter" | Filtered-empty state | Guides to clear filter |

### States

#### Populated (Default)

Card grid with project cards, filter dropdown, "New Project" button visible.

#### Loading (Initial)

Skeleton card grid mirroring the populated layout — 3 placeholder cards per row on desktop, 2 on tablet, 1 on mobile. Each skeleton card shows: gray rounded rect for icon, 2 skeleton text lines for name + description, skeleton bar for progress. Title area and filter dropdown visible but disabled skeuomorphs.

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  # Projects                    [>Status ▼]  [+ New Project]      |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                                    |
|  +-- SkeletonCard -+  +-- SkeletonCard -+  +-- SkeletonCard ---+ |
|  |  [====icon===]  |  |  [====icon===]  |  |  [====icon===]    | |
|  |  [===name====]  |  |  [===name====]  |  |  [===name====]    | |
|  |  [==descrip==]  |  |  [==descrip==]  |  |  [==descrip==]    | |
|  |  [===prog===]   |  |  [===prog===]   |  |  [===prog===]     | |
|  +------------------+  +------------------+  +-------------------+ |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

#### Loading (More)

Card grid visible. Spinner below cards. Scroll sentinel observed.

#### Empty (First Run)

EmptyState with icon, "No projects yet", "Create your first project to get started".

#### Empty (Filtered)

EmptyState with search icon, "No projects match this filter", "Try a different status filter."

#### Error

Inline ErrorBanner above card area with message + Retry button.

#### Success (Post-Creation)

New project appears at top of card grid (handled via store update). Success toast shown.

---

## Section 2 — CreateProjectDialog

### Purpose & Flow Context

Modal dialog for creating a new project. Opened from ProjectsPage "New Project" button. Closed on cancel, success, or Escape. On success, project is prepended to the list and a success toast appears.

### Content hierarchy
1. Modal title "Create Project"
2. Form fields (teamId hidden, name required, description optional, startDate/targetDate optional)
3. Actions: Cancel (secondary) + Create Project (primary)
4. Server error (conditional, form-level)

```
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|  (backdrop bg-black/50 covering entire viewport)                 |
|                                                                |
|  +-- Modal max-w-lg ------------------------------------------+ |
|  |  +-- header ---------------------------------------------+ | |
|  |  |  # Create Project                           [X] close | | |
|  |  +--------------------------------------------------------+ | |
|  |                                                             | |
|  |  +-- form body -------------------------------------------+ | |
|  |  |                                                         | | |
|  |  |  Name *                                                 | | |
|  |  |  ___________________________________________________  | | |
|  |  |                                                         | | |
|  |  |  Description                                            | | |
|  |  |  ___________________________________________________  | | |
|  |  |  ___________________________________________________  | | |
|  |  |                                                         | | |
|  |  |  Start Date                                             | | |
|  |  |  ___________________________________________________  | | |
|  |  |                                                         | | |
|  |  |  Target Date                                            | | |
|  |  |  ___________________________________________________  | | |
|  |  |                                                         | | |
|  |  |  [ErrorBanner] — form-level server error (conditional)  | | |
|  |  |                                                         | | |
|  |  |  [Cancel]                [Create Project]               | | |
|  |  +--------------------------------------------------------+ | |
|  +-------------------------------------------------------------+ |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
```

### Components & Affordances

| Element | DS Component | Behavior | Edge Cases |
|---------|-------------|----------|------------|
| Modal wrapper | Modal | Opens with animation, focus trap, Escape closes | Backdrop clicks close |
| Name input | TextInput with label | Required, 1-255 chars, inline error | Show error on blur + submit |
| Description | Textarea | Optional, max 1000 chars, char counter | — |
| Start Date | TextInput (type="date") | Optional ISO date | Browser native date picker |
| Target Date | TextInput (type="date") | Optional ISO date | Browser native date picker |
| Error display | ErrorBanner | Form-level server error (400/422) | Inline below fields |
| Cancel button | Button (secondary, md) | Closes modal, no creation | — |
| Submit button | Button (primary, md, loading) | Submits form, shows Spinner during loading | Disabled when submitting |
| Toast (success) | Toast (success) | "Project created" after success | Auto-dismiss 5s |

### Data Display

Standard form layout. No data display — this is a creation form.

### Content & Microcopy Intent

| Slot | Intent | Notes |
|------|--------|-------|
| "Create Project" | Modal title + submit button | Consistent label |
| "Name *" | Required field label | Asterisk indicates required |
| "Description" | Optional field label | — |
| "Start Date" | Optional date field label | — |
| "Target Date" | Optional date field label | — |
| "Cancel" | Secondary action | Dismiss without saving |
| "Project created" | Success toast | Brief, positive |

### States

#### Open (Idle)

Empty form with all fields ready. Submit button enabled. Cancel button visible.

#### Open (Submitting)

Submit button shows loading spinner (Spinner inside Button). Fields disabled. Cancel still enabled but ideally disabled.

#### Open (Error — Field Validation)

Inline validation errors below each field. Name required, max length, date format errors. Submit button re-enabled after user edits.

#### Open (Error — Server Error)

Form-level ErrorBanner with server message (400 validation, 422 business rule). Fields remain editable. Submit button re-enabled.

#### Success

Modal closes. New project appears at top of ProjectsPage list. Toast "Project created" appears.

### Responsive

Same as system Modal — max-w-lg centered, full-width on mobile with padding.

### Accessibility — Screen Composition

| Concern | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Landmarks | Modal is in `main` region of parent page |
| Heading order | "Create Project" is h2 (under page h1) |
| Focus order | Tab: Name → Description → Start Date → Target Date → Cancel → Create Project |
| Focus trap | Modal traps focus when open; restored on close |
| Escape | Closes modal |
| Accessible names | Close button `aria-label="Close"`, submit button labeled |
| Keyboard operability | Tab between fields, Enter submits, Escape closes |
| Target size | All interactive targets ≥24×24 CSS px |

## Assumptions / Open Questions

1. Team ID is currently hardcoded (`default-team-id`). The create project flow assumes a team context is available.
